## Summary
Thousands of Palestinians remain buried beneath the rubble of buildings destroyed by Israeli strikes early in the war, according to a local journalist speaking to RT. Gaza rescue teams are still conducting search and recovery operations to locate the victims.

## Key Points
- Thousands of Palestinians remain buried beneath buildings destroyed in Israeli strikes
- The destruction occurred during the early phase of the war
- Gaza rescue teams are still actively searching for those trapped beneath the ruins
- A local journalist provided firsthand reporting on the ongoing recovery efforts to RT


